  gameTitle: ' Rescue at Deaths Coffin'
  startText: Start
  tutorialButtonText: How To Play
  sceneToLoad: 
  pauseWhileOpen: 1
  tutorialTitle: How To Play
  tutorialText: 'Theres been a murder!.

    And of the 2 people here tonight 1 of them is a monster/murderer.

    Speak with them and keep an eye out for things in the environment that may help.


    WASD  -  Walk

    Shift  -  Sprint

    Mouse  -  Look around

    Left click  -  Talk to people

    Hold left click  -  Pick up and carry things

    Right click while carrying  -  Rotate what you''re holding

    Scroll while carrying  -  Move it closer or further away

    Mouse, number keys or W/S + E  -  Pick what to say

    Tab  -  Leave a conversation'
